ds the strictly decreasing basis tensor `tvec d` to `tvec (d ∘ w⁻¹)`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.prod_reverse_adjT","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.prod_reverse_adjT","kind":"theorem","line":205,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnFaithful.lean#L205-L211","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.adjT_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.adjT_inv","kind":"theorem","line":203,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnFaithful.lean#L203-L203","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.action_word","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.action_word","kind":"theorem","line":178,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnFaithful.lean#L178-L201","doc":"**Along a reduced word, the Hecke action permutes a strictly decreasing basis tensor.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ninv_mul_adjT_of_gt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ninv_mul_adjT_of_gt","kind":"theorem","line":166,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnFaithful.lean#L166-L174","doc":"At a descent of `π` at `i`, right multiplication by `s_i` removes an inversion. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ninv_mul_word_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ninv_mul_word_le","kind":"theorem","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnFaithful.lean#L156-L164","doc":"Head-recursive bound: `ninv (π · s_{u₀} ⋯ s_{u_l}) ≤ ninv π + l`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ninv_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ninv_inv","kind":"theorem","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnFaithful.lean#L139-L154","doc":"`ninv w⁻¹ = ninv w`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.gen_tvec'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.gen_tvec'","kind":"theorem","line":130,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnFaithful.lean#L130-L135","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.gen_tvec","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.gen_tvec","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnFaithful.lean#L89-L128","doc":"**On a descent the crossing is a pure swap**: if `a (i+1) < a i` then the crossing on strands\n`i, i+1` sends `tvec a` to `tvec (a ∘ (i i+1))`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.adjT_succ_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.adjT_succ_succ","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnFaithful.lean#L84-L87","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.adjT_succ_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.adjT_succ_zero","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnFaithful.lean#L80-L82","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.adjT_zero_ss","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.adjT_zero_ss","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnFaithful.lean#L76-L78","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.adjT_zero_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.adjT_zero_one","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnFaithful.lean#L73-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.adjT_zero_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.adjT_zero_zero","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnFaithful.lean#L70-L71","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.whiskerLeft_X_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.whiskerLeft_X_apply","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnFaithful.lean#L67-L68","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.tvec_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.tvec_succ","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnFaithful.lean#L59-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.tvec","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.tvec","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96a